desktop-idle-status (0.1.2-1ppa1~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add persisted Ignore / Stop Ignoring actions for applications holding
    screensaver (idle) blockers in the widget.
  * Exclude ignored applications from blocker status, tray counts and new
    blocking history.
  * Show the screensaver when the user is away past its timeout and only
    ignored applications are blocking; leave sleep blockers unaffected.
  * Bridge built against libkwin6 4:6.6.6-0ubuntu0.1.

